<p>Former Nepal Prime Minister K.P. Sharma Oli and former Home Minister Ramesh Lekhak were arrested in Kathmandu on Saturday as authorities moved to act on the findings of a commission that investigated the deadly suppression of anti-corruption youth protests last September. The protests, often described in coverage as a Gen Z uprising, helped topple Oli’s government after security forces cracked down on demonstrators. Reports put the death toll at more than 70 people, and as high as 77. The arrests came a day after Prime Minister Balendra Shah and his cabinet were sworn in following Nepal’s first election since the 2025 uprising. That timing gives the case broad political weight: it shows the new government is letting the legal process tied to the protest killings move ahead, even against one of the country’s most powerful former leaders. In a country still absorbing the upheaval of the past year, the move is also an early test of whether demands for accountability from the protest movement will lead to formal justice through Nepal’s institutions.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/O7_t157ycquc0WEgZXWki8NIlXIhshG04Ee2VlARNnCLfs5I_i5WQppCAX10XuSnGeFTTLUbj5gMTURSmU2ltU18PjgseLaMcwhizWS8gvlUDzcyfGrIvdPLjT9jRSTMn-g_oPYtFFS5LnyKEzGjynT3_cYPnEkZof4r5vwkoA' alt='Image accompanying coverage of the arrest of former Nepal prime minister K.P. Sharma Oli.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Detention site: The Guardian said police detained Oli at his residence in Kathmandu.</li><li>Veteran leader: SCMP and NDTV said Oli was 74 at the time of his arrest.</li><li>Long tenure: The Guardian described Oli as a three-time former prime minister.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/nepal-former-pm-oli-arrested-over-deadly-protests/a-76573671'>Nepal: Former PM Oli arrested over deadly protests</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/nepal-police-arrest-former-prime-minister-former-home-131494735'>Nepal police arrest former prime minister and another ex-official over protest deaths</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/south-asia/article/3348224/nepals-ex-pm-kp-sharma-oli-arrested-over-alleged-role-crackdown-protesters'>Nepal’s ex-PM K.P. Sharma Oli arrested over alleged role in crackdown on protesters</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/prime-minister-to-ouster-to-arrest-rise-and-fall-of-kp-sharma-oli-nepal-ex-prime-minister-gen-z-protests-11277724#publisher=newsstand'>Prime Minister To Ouster To Arrest: Rise And Fall Of KP Sharma Oli</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/nepals-former-pm-oli-arrested-over-deaths-during-gen-z-protests/article70795245.ece'>Former Nepal PM Oli, ex-Home Minister Lekhak arrested over Gen Z protest killings</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cn89ry7y835o'>Nepal&#x27;s ex-PM arrested over fatal protest crackdown</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/28/kp-sharma-oli-nepal-arrested-alleged-role-protest-crackdown-ntwnfb'>KP Sharma Oli: Nepal’s former prime minister arrested over alleged role in deadly protest crackdown</a> - theguardian.com</li></ul>